{% extends 'site/guideBase.html.twig' %}
{% block content %}
    <div class="uw-card">
        <div class="uw-card-header">Construction</div>
        <div class="uw-card-body">
            <p>
                To construct buildings or train units, click on one of your regions on the <a href="{{ url('Guide/World') }}">world map</a>.
                This opens the region panel where you can select what to build.
            </p>
            <p>
                Each region has a limited amount of building space (default 1000). Buildings and units take up space,
                cost resources (Cash, Wood, Steel, Food), and take time to complete. You can cancel constructions in progress.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <br/>

    <div class="uw-card">
        <div class="uw-card-header">Unit Categories</div>
        <div class="uw-card-body">
            <p>There are several categories of buildings and units you can construct:</p>

            <b>Buildings</b>
            <ul>
                <li>Economic Center &mdash; Generates cash income</li>
                <li>Farm &mdash; Generates food</li>
                <li>Iron Mine &mdash; Generates steel</li>
                <li>Woodcutter &mdash; Generates wood</li>
                <li>House &mdash; Provides population</li>
            </ul>

            <b>Special Buildings</b>
            <p>These buildings unlock the ability to train advanced units:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Barrack &mdash; Required for training troops</li>
                <li>Factory &mdash; Required for Tanks and Artillery</li>
                <li>Airfield &mdash; Required for air units (Fighter, Bomber, Strategic Bomber)</li>
                <li>Harbor &mdash; Required for naval units (region must be coastal)</li>
                <li>Missile Factory &mdash; Required for missiles</li>
                <li>Radar Station, Train Station &mdash; Special purpose buildings</li>
            </ul>

            <b>Defense Buildings</b>
            <ul>
                <li>Bunker, Mine Fields, Sea Mine, Anti Aircraft Gun &mdash; Protect your region from attacks</li>
            </ul>

            <b>Troops</b>
            <ul>
                <li>Soldier, Sniper, Mine Sweeper &mdash; Infantry (attack range: 1 tile)</li>
                <li>Tank, Artillery &mdash; Heavy ground units (attack range: 2 tiles, requires Factory)</li>
            </ul>

            <b>Air Units</b> (require Airfield)
            <ul>
                <li>Fighter &mdash; Attack range: 3 tiles</li>
                <li>Bomber &mdash; Attack range: 5 tiles</li>
                <li>Strategic Bomber &mdash; Attack range: 7 tiles</li>
            </ul>

            <b>Naval Units</b> (require Harbor on a coastal region)
            <ul>
                <li>Patrol Boat, Destroyer, Cruiser, Submarine, Mine Countermeasures Ship</li>
                <li>Naval units can only attack coastal targets (range: 1 tile)</li>
            </ul>

            <b>Missiles</b> (require Missile Factory)
            <ul>
                <li>Rocket, Chemical Rocket, Nuclear Missile</li>
            </ul>

            <p>
                For detailed stats, costs, and requirements for each unit, see the <a href="{{ url('Guide/ListUnits') }}">Game Units</a> page.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
